      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JUMBUK FUNI (1) was out of the placings last time when seventh at Traralgon (25.41) but did record second best time of the card when winning three back. Won at her only start from this draw. Ready to return to form. WALTER WALRUS (6) has a strong record this track and trip with six wins and four placings from 18 starts. Missed the frame latest (19.96) when sixth over 350m at this track in a Bottom Up - Grade 5. Suited here and expected to run well. HYLAND AZULA (8) had a tricky draw and ran well to finish second, beaten 2 lengths, (17.12) at this track. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Will give a great sight again. SQUEEGEE'S RIDE (2) looks an each-way chance.",
